WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.975
Section 2.

00:00:01.925 --> 00:00:04.312
UN Committee Findings.

00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:11.287
The UN Committee noted that laws permitting assisted dying may put at risk the lives of persons with disabilities.

00:00:11.287 --> 00:00:19.012
The UN Special Rapporteur stated that Canada's approach may effectively offer death as an alternative to support services.
